{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.2"
  description: "A name type a record states was written by its author, so it resolves in the author's schema first, as an enum's does: this schema declares its own `field_name`, admitting a leading '@', and `stated` names it. A record stating no name type has the kernel's `field_name` whatever the schema declares."
